# Keep the deploy archive small enough to survive an unreliable upload.
#
# The 2026-08-28 deploy stalled at 20 of 80.6MB and timed out. Most of that
# weight never belonged in a serverless bundle:
#
#   graphify-out/   48MB of code-graph analysis artefacts, tooling-only
#   *.wav           33MB of raw background-music takes; nothing imports them
#                   (the shipped page uses the 29KB bg-music.mp3)
#   docs/, scripts/ developer material the app never serves
#
# hse-hub-ad.mp4 (20MB) IS referenced by /video and /demo, so it stays.
graphify-out
.context-bridge
.v3code
docs
scripts
supabase/migrations
public/bg-music.wav
public/bg-music-v2.wav
public/bg-music-v3.wav
*.xlsx
tmp-*.png
